<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bridgestone yr net profit up 4.2 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bridgestone yr net profit up 4.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    20.09 vs 21.27</p>
<p>    Net				     15.82 vs 15.19</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     8.75 vs 7.50</p>
<p>NOTE: Bridgestone Australia Ltd is a tyre maker and is about 60 percent owned by Bridgestone Corp of Japan.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	    13.75 vs 12.50</p>
<p>    Sales				  437.85 vs 430.82</p>
<p>    Other income			   2.99 vs 3.24</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   43.30 vs 41.60</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 4.99 vs nil</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 pct franked</p>
<p>Pay date Apr 30</p>
<p>Reg date Mar 27</p>
<p>    Tax					9.26 vs 6.09</p>
<p>    Interest				 3.80 vs 4.84</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   8.21 vs 17.40</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
